{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furry\u00a0Company\u00a0-\u00a0relaxing simulation game (Free Demo during Steam Next Fest!)\u00a0If you like it, don\u2019t forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/01.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wanna know about our development progress or future updates? Join our community and chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furry Company is a relaxing simulation game sits at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other task while letting adorable animals work for you and build your dream company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/01\u81ea\u7531\u642d\u914d_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200bThe game offers diverse range of themed scenes\u00a0(Basic Style, Magical Castle, Space Design, or Toy Town.)\u00a0and\u00a0over 100+\u00a0furniture to match.\u00a0You can\u00a0Unleash your creativity and design your ideal workspace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u88c5\u4fee\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u53e4\u5821\u753b\u98ce.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02\u966a\u4f60\u4e0a\u73ed_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a wide variety of adorable animals (only a few designs are shown here), each with unique appearances, colors, and outfits. Can you recognize all your employees?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More\u00a0mystery\u00a0animals are waiting to make their debut!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u52a8\u7269\u4e92\u52a8.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/image.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/03\u8d85\u840c\u66b4\u51fb_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your animal employees have various behaviors that require your attention! When they act strangely, make sure to address their needs. Keep them happy with ice cream bribes \u2013 productivity meets hilarity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u7981\u6b62\u52a8\u7269\u6478\u9c7c.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every piece of furniture you buy for the office unlocks new interactions for your animal employees. The more variety you add, the richer their behaviors become! Plus, you can click on these cute furniture items with your mouse to interact with them yourself!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u5bb6\u5177\u4e92\u52a8.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/04\u6478\u9c7c\u5230\u5e95_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Key Mode: One-click minimize to &quot;spreadsheet&quot; camouflage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u8001\u677f\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div><br>Pocket Mode: Shrink your company into a taskbar pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u684c\u5ba0\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div><br>Custom Window: Disguise as a &quot;productivity widget&quot; (we won't tell)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u684c\u9762\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557690?t=1751597105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/e5478dab5f2f4cbf8eacd52f030a6806506e1296/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751597105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/f6dbff47a39b8d442b8072019e2673eb4716f412/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751597105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/f6dbff47a39b8d442b8072019e2673eb4716f412/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751597105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3761980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furry\u00a0Company\u00a0-\u00a0relaxing simulation game (Free Demo during Steam Next Fest!)\u00a0If you like it, don\u2019t forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/01.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wanna know about our development progress or future updates? Join our community and chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furry Company is a relaxing simulation game sits at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other task while letting adorable animals work for you and build your dream company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/01\u81ea\u7531\u642d\u914d_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200bThe game offers diverse range of themed scenes\u00a0(Basic Style, Magical Castle, Space Design, or Toy Town.)\u00a0and\u00a0over 100+\u00a0furniture to match.\u00a0You can\u00a0Unleash your creativity and design your ideal workspace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u88c5\u4fee\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u53e4\u5821\u753b\u98ce.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02\u966a\u4f60\u4e0a\u73ed_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a wide variety of adorable animals (only a few designs are shown here), each with unique appearances, colors, and outfits. Can you recognize all your employees?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More\u00a0mystery\u00a0animals are waiting to make their debut!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u52a8\u7269\u4e92\u52a8.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/image.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/03\u8d85\u840c\u66b4\u51fb_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your animal employees have various behaviors that require your attention! When they act strangely, make sure to address their needs. Keep them happy with ice cream bribes \u2013 productivity meets hilarity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u7981\u6b62\u52a8\u7269\u6478\u9c7c.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every piece of furniture you buy for the office unlocks new interactions for your animal employees. The more variety you add, the richer their behaviors become! Plus, you can click on these cute furniture items with your mouse to interact with them yourself!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u5bb6\u5177\u4e92\u52a8.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/04\u6478\u9c7c\u5230\u5e95_\u82f1.png?t=1751597105\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Key Mode: One-click minimize to &quot;spreadsheet&quot; camouflage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u8001\u677f\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div><br>Pocket Mode: Shrink your company into a taskbar pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u684c\u5ba0\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div><br>Custom Window: Disguise as a &quot;productivity widget&quot; (we won't tell)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/\u684c\u9762\u6a21\u5f0f.gif?t=1751597105\" /></div></p>","developers":["Dreamscape Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/ed2d98fe0028df3f51810fa6713ab8f7df37ac70/header.jpg?t=1751597105","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153931,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153931/movie480.mp4?t=1749695760","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153931/movie_max.mp4?t=1749695760"},"name":"Gameplay Recording\u200b","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.s